(5288942, 770117, 88822, '<td valign="top">I really like the crop.  The problem I''m having is that the focus is in the wrong spot.  In my opinion the focus should be on the end of peel, and it is right underneath the stem of the apple.  Also I would crop the bottom a little more.  the peel there does not add to the shot.</td>', 'I really like the crop.  The problem I''m having is that the focus is in the wrong spot.  In my opinion the focus should be on the end of peel, and it is right underneath the stem of the apple.  Also I would crop the bottom a little more.  the peel there does not add to the shot.', '2009-03-04 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288943, 769862, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well lit shot.  What I find distracting and not necessary are the letters.  This would have been a lot better with them.</td>', 'Good idea and well lit shot.  What I find distracting and not necessary are the letters.  This would have been a lot better with them.', '2009-03-04 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
