(5288954, 769951, 88822, '<td valign="top">I like the sun light, but I find the background busy, and the subject gets lost in it.  A tighter crop with a shallower dof would have made this better, I think.</td>', 'I like the sun light, but I find the background busy, and the subject gets lost in it.  A tighter crop with a shallower dof would have made this better, I think.', '2009-03-04 15:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
