(5288965, 769735, 88822, '<td valign="top">This would work better if it was closer, so you the can spot the "wolf" better.  Well composed, but in my opinion the light is too harsh, washing away the texture of the bananas.</td>', 'This would work better if it was closer, so you the can spot the "wolf" better.  Well composed, but in my opinion the light is too harsh, washing away the texture of the bananas.', '2009-03-04 15:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
