(5288967, 769061, 88822, '<td valign="top">Personally I think the picture would work better if it was showing more body.  Then the bar could play a better part in the whole composition.  As it is now, it just distracts.  Don''t really like the processing either.</td>', 'Personally I think the picture would work better if it was showing more body.  Then the bar could play a better part in the whole composition.  As it is now, it just distracts.  Don''t really like the processing either.', '2009-03-04 15:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288968, 769371, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good textures, but I find that there is not enough in focus to make it interesting.</td>', 'Good textures, but I find that there is not enough in focus to make it interesting.', '2009-03-04 15:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288969, 770122, 88822, '<td valign="top">Interesting view.  I think a little tighter crop from the left would help, but I like the light and texture.</td>', 'Interesting view.  I think a little tighter crop from the left would help, but I like the light and texture.', '2009-03-04 15:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288970, 770090, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good texture and composition, but parts of the cactus are a little over exposed, which takes away from the over all image.</td>', 'Good texture and composition, but parts of the cactus are a little over exposed, which takes away from the over all image.', '2009-03-04 15:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288971, 769689, 88822, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop would work better.  You have good texture of the skin, but there background and the harsh shadow is disctracting.</td>', 'I think a closer crop would work better.  You have good texture of the skin, but there background and the harsh shadow is disctracting.', '2009-03-04 15:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288972, 770087, 88822, '<td valign="top">Background is too messy (wrinkles!!) Light a little harsh.  Otherwise nice natural expression and well composed portrait.</td>', 'Background is too messy (wrinkles!!) Light a little harsh.  Otherwise nice natural expression and well composed portrait.', '2009-03-04 15:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288973, 770007, 88822, '<td valign="top">Smaller aperture would have worked better here.  As it stands only the left side around the eye is really in focus.  Maybe focusing on the great nose texture cats have would have been better?</td>', 'Smaller aperture would have worked better here.  As it stands only the left side around the eye is really in focus.  Maybe focusing on the great nose texture cats have would have been better?', '2009-03-04 15:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288974, 769833, 88822, '<td valign="top">Personally, the center composition does not work very well here, plus the fact that the object is over exposed.  The DOF is good though.</td>', 'Personally, the center composition does not work very well here, plus the fact that the object is over exposed.  The DOF is good though.', '2009-03-04 15:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288975, 769960, 88822, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF does not really work in favor here.  Otherwise good composition and light.</td>', 'The shallow DOF does not really work in favor here.  Otherwise good composition and light.', '2009-03-04 15:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288976, 770063, 88822, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this would have worked a lot better if the focus was everywhere, and not predominantly on the hair.  Also the two fingers are not necessary, and are distracting.</td>', 'In my opinion this would have worked a lot better if the focus was everywhere, and not predominantly on the hair.  Also the two fingers are not necessary, and are distracting.', '2009-03-04 15:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288977, 769476, 88822, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture, but you will get voted down on the size of the shot.</td>', 'Interesting texture, but you will get voted down on the size of the shot.', '2009-03-04 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288978, 769654, 88822, '<td valign="top">Or barely enough :) ... It''s a good shot, but a little more skin would fit the challenge better .</td>', 'Or barely enough :) ... It''s a good shot, but a little more skin would fit the challenge better .', '2009-03-04 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288979, 769143, 88822, '<td valign="top">I think a little more of the face showing would have been better.  Also I would turn this photo completely b&amp;w.  As it stands there still some color showing around the horns, which is distracting to me.</td>', 'I think a little more of the face showing would have been better.  Also I would turn this photo completely b&w.  As it stands there still some color showing around the horns, which is distracting to me.', '2009-03-04 15:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288980, 769918, 88822, '<td valign="top">Well captured, but I would desaturate the skin a little.  Because it fills the whole shot it gives it a too orange/peach cast which does not work well with the yellow of the gold band.</td>', 'Well captured, but I would desaturate the skin a little.  Because it fills the whole shot it gives it a too orange/peach cast which does not work well with the yellow of the gold band.', '2009-03-04 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288981, 769147, 88822, '<td valign="top">in my opinion the focus of the image is the ornament, and not the skin.  yes the skin is there, but it''s not the main focus of the shot.  I would crop out the two black corners, because as it is now they are distracting.</td>', 'in my opinion the focus of the image is the ornament, and not the skin.  yes the skin is there, but it''s not the main focus of the shot.  I would crop out the two black corners, because as it is now they are distracting.', '2009-03-04 15:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288982, 769842, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the light is too harsh, washing away the detail.  I would prefer the sleeve not to be showing.  Also this would probably work better if it was straight vertical position of the hands.</td>', 'Good idea, but the light is too harsh, washing away the detail.  I would prefer the sleeve not to be showing.  Also this would probably work better if it was straight vertical position of the hands.', '2009-03-04 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288983, 769750, 88822, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if the focus was on the whole banana.  Other than that, it''s well composed shot.</td>', 'Would have been better if the focus was on the whole banana.  Other than that, it''s well composed shot.', '2009-03-04 15:04:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5288984, 769505, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  In my opinion the black background does not really add to the image.  The green should have been the whole background.  Also the light is harsh on the peeler, and the green surface.</td>', 'Good idea.  In my opinion the black background does not really add to the image.  The green should have been the whole background.  Also the light is harsh on the peeler, and the green surface.', '2009-03-04 15:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288985, 768668, 88822, '<td valign="top">INteresting image. the shallow dof does not really work in bringing the rest of the subject in to sharp focus.</td>', 'INteresting image. the shallow dof does not really work in bringing the rest of the subject in to sharp focus.', '2009-03-04 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288986, 768425, 88822, '<td valign="top">The background does not work here very well.  the subject has nice texture, but there is too much dark space with takes away from the idea.  Either shine more light from a different angle or crop out the black space.</td>', 'The background does not work here very well.  the subject has nice texture, but there is too much dark space with takes away from the idea.  Either shine more light from a different angle or crop out the black space.', '2009-03-04 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288987, 769383, 88822, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the light makes this a little flat.  The background would be better if it was uniform, and not black and blue.  Also I find the crop to be a little tight.</td>', 'Good idea, but the light makes this a little flat.  The background would be better if it was uniform, and not black and blue.  Also I find the crop to be a little tight.', '2009-03-04 15:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288988, 768475, 88822, '<td valign="top">If this is the tail, I don''t really want to know what is on the other side :)  To me the lighting and colors are  a little flat.   You have good texture, but over all the noise does not help here.</td>', 'If this is the tail, I don''t really want to know what is on the other side :)  To me the lighting and colors are  a little flat.   You have good texture, but over all the noise does not help here.', '2009-03-04 15:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288989, 768576, 88822, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus, and the lines extending from his nose are very unnecessary.  They ruin the picture for me.</td>', 'A bit out of focus, and the lines extending from his nose are very unnecessary.  They ruin the picture for me.', '2009-03-04 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288990, 769043, 88822, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus, and flat.  More saturation and levels would help this image.</td>', 'A little out of focus, and flat.  More saturation and levels would help this image.', '2009-03-04 15:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288991, 770124, 88822, '<td valign="top">Nice symetry.  The light is a little flat, and the image is small.</td>', 'Nice symetry.  The light is a little flat, and the image is small.', '2009-03-04 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288993, 769961, 88822, '<td valign="top">Don''t really understand.  The syringe being out of focus does not help, and the "Milky skin" is washed out so much that I cannot tell what it is exactly.</td>', 'Don''t really understand.  The syringe being out of focus does not help, and the "Milky skin" is washed out so much that I cannot tell what it is exactly.', '2009-03-04 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5288994, 769037, 88822, '<td valign="top">Over processed.  Focus not uniform on the lizard.  You have good skin texture happening in the middle of his body, but that''s the only saving grace.  Sorry.</td>', 'Over processed.  Focus not uniform on the lizard.  You have good skin texture happening in the middle of his body, but that''s the only saving grace.  Sorry.', '2009-03-04 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
