(5289975, 769689, 29009, '<td valign="top">On the right track.  Lighting is very harsh with the shadows, and there is really nothing super interesting about the back of the earring.  Background doesn''t give context - why is the hair wet?  This could use a better story.</td>', 'On the right track.  Lighting is very harsh with the shadows, and there is really nothing super interesting about the back of the earring.  Background doesn''t give context - why is the hair wet?  This could use a better story.', '2009-03-04 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289980, 769779, 29009, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a statement; the boy''s facial expression should reciprocate the feeling.  Instead he just looks confused.</td>', 'Not bad for a statement; the boy''s facial expression should reciprocate the feeling.  Instead he just looks confused.', '2009-03-04 22:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
