(5289989, 769951, 29009, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Backlighting is nice -- too bad the background competes so much with the subject.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Backlighting is nice -- too bad the background competes so much with the subject.', '2009-03-04 22:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289990, 770047, 29009, '<td valign="top">Lighting needs work -- it''s too flat to be interesting.  Composition is off, there is no story here.  This is really just marginally better than snapshot.</td>', 'Lighting needs work -- it''s too flat to be interesting.  Composition is off, there is no story here.  This is really just marginally better than snapshot.', '2009-03-04 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289998, 769903, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition is pretty interesting.  The colors are rather dull and boring, and there is a ton of noise in the background.  I like the idea, but the rainbow background is killing it.</td>', 'Composition is pretty interesting.  The colors are rather dull and boring, and there is a ton of noise in the background.  I like the idea, but the rainbow background is killing it.', '2009-03-04 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289999, 770032, 29009, '<td valign="top">Pick a direction - soft skin or hard body; then choose focus appropriately.</td>', 'Pick a direction - soft skin or hard body; then choose focus appropriately.', '2009-03-04 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290003, 769667, 29009, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject; perspective is rather dull and uninteresting.  Background does nothing for this shot; it has little context.  Try it again from above the plant using directional lighting and see what you think.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject; perspective is rather dull and uninteresting.  Background does nothing for this shot; it has little context.  Try it again from above the plant using directional lighting and see what you think.', '2009-03-04 22:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290009, 769645, 29009, '<td valign="top">There''s really no story here unless someone reads the title.  Nice job on the skin, but it''s a standard perspective and not showing anything in a new or unusual way.  You got the good DOF going, but the background is so bright it''s not adding much to the overall shot.</td>', 'There''s really no story here unless someone reads the title.  Nice job on the skin, but it''s a standard perspective and not showing anything in a new or unusual way.  You got the good DOF going, but the background is so bright it''s not adding much to the overall shot.', '2009-03-04 22:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290015, 769750, 29009, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t make me want to eat bananas.  This is a rather uninteresting perspective, there is no story or context to the main subject, even the color is a bit green for a bunch of yellow bananas.  I can see that you are trying, but this falls a bit short for a stock shot and isn''t really good for anything else.</td>', 'This doesn''t make me want to eat bananas.  This is a rather uninteresting perspective, there is no story or context to the main subject, even the color is a bit green for a bunch of yellow bananas.  I can see that you are trying, but this falls a bit short for a stock shot and isn''t really good for anything else.', '2009-03-04 22:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290022, 769985, 29009, '<td valign="top">Hmm, interesting concept - that lotion will make oranges smooth.  Congrats on having something to say.  Technicals are good - focus is on and the reflection is nice.  Colors pop - also good.  I don''t like it very much more than a 7, but it''s so much better than the others in the challenge I''ll give it an 8 to make sure it scores above the ones without a story or a message.</td>', 'Hmm, interesting concept - that lotion will make oranges smooth.  Congrats on having something to say.  Technicals are good - focus is on and the reflection is nice.  Colors pop - also good.  I don''t like it very much more than a 7, but it''s so much better than the others in the challenge I''ll give it an 8 to make sure it scores above the ones without a story or a message.', '2009-03-04 22:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290024, 769476, 29009, '<td valign="top">You might be able to use this as a texture background later, but as a shot on it''s own there is really just nothing here that is interesting.</td>', 'You might be able to use this as a texture background later, but as a shot on it''s own there is really just nothing here that is interesting.', '2009-03-04 22:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290026, 769037, 29009, '<td valign="top">Way too much noise to be a serious contender in the challenge.  Otherwise, composition and focus are fine.</td>', 'Way too much noise to be a serious contender in the challenge.  Otherwise, composition and focus are fine.', '2009-03-04 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290029, 769321, 29009, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t support the title.  Most of the texture of the skin is blown out.  I''m not even really sold on the composition.  DOF is pretty good though.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t support the title.  Most of the texture of the skin is blown out.  I''m not even really sold on the composition.  DOF is pretty good though.', '2009-03-04 22:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290032, 768475, 29009, '<td valign="top">No story, dull colors, no context, too much noise.  Otherwise, interesting skin.</td>', 'No story, dull colors, no context, too much noise.  Otherwise, interesting skin.', '2009-03-04 22:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
