(5290452, 768542, 95579, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but Im holding off voting on it until I decide how well it meets the challenge.<br/>The water droplets and the overall greeness I think are superb though. i will be back!<br/>Okay Im back! im dropping you 1 point for how well it fits the challenge, but only 1 as I like to think outside the box!<br/>The effect of this shot is good with the oof edges and the lines of the grass leading to the drops. Might have been better with a small border to frame it</td>', 'I like the shot but Im holding off voting on it until I decide how well it meets the challenge.The water droplets and the overall greeness I think are superb though. i will be back!Okay Im back! im dropping you 1 point for how well it fits the challenge, but only 1 as I like to think outside the box!The effect of this shot is good with the oof edges and the lines of the grass leading to the drops. Might have been better with a small border to frame it', '2009-03-05 04:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
