(5297878, 770061, 84438, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea. I wish the hands were against a background that offered a little more contrast.  Also, the lighting seems a little ''flat'', and therefore appears to lose some texture in the hands.</td>', 'A very nice idea. I wish the hands were against a background that offered a little more contrast.  Also, the lighting seems a little ''flat'', and therefore appears to lose some texture in the hands.', '2009-03-09 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297880, 769750, 84438, '<td valign="top">A picture of fruit really has to knock me out to get a good score.  While I think that the lighting is good, and the composition of the bananas on the hanger is very nice, I''m not going crazy for this one.</td>', 'A picture of fruit really has to knock me out to get a good score.  While I think that the lighting is good, and the composition of the bananas on the hanger is very nice, I''m not going crazy for this one.', '2009-03-09 16:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297883, 770007, 84438, '<td valign="top">Haha..  Funny.  <br/> <br/>This is actually a decent photo, though I wish the background wasn''t so dark.  The cat seems ominous..  I don''t think she would be a very benevolent leader.</td>', 'Haha..  Funny.   This is actually a decent photo, though I wish the background wasn''t so dark.  The cat seems ominous..  I don''t think she would be a very benevolent leader.', '2009-03-09 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297885, 769727, 84438, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice execution!  Two things are stopping me from giving this a super high score:  The label is not affixed to the potato in the corners which detracts, and also that lighting on the label could have been a bit better.<br/> <br/>Very unique image though!</td>', 'Great idea and nice execution!  Two things are stopping me from giving this a super high score:  The label is not affixed to the potato in the corners which detracts, and also that lighting on the label could have been a bit better. Very unique image though!', '2009-03-09 16:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297888, 769982, 84438, '<td valign="top">I really like this image..  I think that this would have been a winner in my books if the background didn''t blend in quite so much with the mask.  I think that a lighter background would have really brought out the details in this.  Even having said that, I really like what you did here.</td>', 'I really like this image..  I think that this would have been a winner in my books if the background didn''t blend in quite so much with the mask.  I think that a lighter background would have really brought out the details in this.  Even having said that, I really like what you did here.', '2009-03-09 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297891, 769961, 84438, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  I''m sorry, but I''m just not understanding this photo.</td>', 'Hmm...  I''m sorry, but I''m just not understanding this photo.', '2009-03-09 16:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297895, 769939, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I''m not sure what that object is over the belly button, but I''m not sure if it helps the photo.  Either way, I really like this.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I''m not sure what that object is over the belly button, but I''m not sure if it helps the photo.  Either way, I really like this.', '2009-03-09 16:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297897, 769970, 84438, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!  I find the red to be a bit distracting, but you definitely get points for originality.</td>', 'Great idea!!  I find the red to be a bit distracting, but you definitely get points for originality.', '2009-03-09 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297901, 769840, 84438, '<td valign="top">Now this is a beautiful photo.  The smoothness of the skin and the tricked out eyes is on the cusp of looking overprocessed, but it definitely grabs your attention.  Nice work.</td>', 'Now this is a beautiful photo.  The smoothness of the skin and the tricked out eyes is on the cusp of looking overprocessed, but it definitely grabs your attention.  Nice work.', '2009-03-09 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297904, 769735, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but I wish the concept came through a little bit clearer.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but I wish the concept came through a little bit clearer.', '2009-03-09 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297905, 768646, 84438, '<td valign="top">You''ve done an excellent job at making a bland subject very interesting.  Awesome!</td>', 'You''ve done an excellent job at making a bland subject very interesting.  Awesome!', '2009-03-09 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297911, 770121, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and a unique look.  The grain and the low key look works here.</td>', 'Very artistic and a unique look.  The grain and the low key look works here.', '2009-03-09 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297916, 768425, 84438, '<td valign="top">My two second glance almost made me give this a 5..  However, the longer I look at it, the more there is to see, and I like what is coming through.  7.</td>', 'My two second glance almost made me give this a 5..  However, the longer I look at it, the more there is to see, and I like what is coming through.  7.', '2009-03-09 16:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297921, 769147, 84438, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to like about this image.  It grows on me the more I look at it.  I really like how you''ve lined up the bracelet with the lights in the background.  Beautiful.</td>', 'There is a lot to like about this image.  It grows on me the more I look at it.  I really like how you''ve lined up the bracelet with the lights in the background.  Beautiful.', '2009-03-09 16:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297923, 769852, 84438, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.  Nice.</td>', 'Simple but effective.  Nice.', '2009-03-09 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297924, 768772, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  Really nice.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  Really nice.', '2009-03-09 17:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298075, 768715, 104612, '<td valign="top">Effort to clean sensor before the shoot was not done, lots of sensor dust.</td>', 'Effort to clean sensor before the shoot was not done, lots of sensor dust.', '2009-03-09 18:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298080, 770063, 104612, '<td valign="top">The upper 2/3rds of the photograph are distracting, so I suggest a tighter crop and a smaller aperture should have been used</td>', 'The upper 2/3rds of the photograph are distracting, so I suggest a tighter crop and a smaller aperture should have been used', '2009-03-09 18:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298086, 769862, 104612, '<td valign="top">A smaller apperture and a tighter focus, and the background lint is very distrating.</td>', 'A smaller apperture and a tighter focus, and the background lint is very distrating.', '2009-03-09 18:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298090, 769704, 104612, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Foreground rock is a disturbance, but with animals it''s hard to always get the just right perspective.</td>', 'Very nice! Foreground rock is a disturbance, but with animals it''s hard to always get the just right perspective.', '2009-03-09 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298098, 770029, 104612, '<td valign="top">Highlights are washed out. Smaller aperture and the use of a tripod would make this a winner.</td>', 'Highlights are washed out. Smaller aperture and the use of a tripod would make this a winner.', '2009-03-09 18:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298106, 769939, 104612, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of a famous photograph however lower right area where there is no definition of any kind is distracting.</td>', 'Nice rendition of a famous photograph however lower right area where there is no definition of any kind is distracting.', '2009-03-09 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298110, 769383, 104612, '<td valign="top">Very well lit, great definition and composition. A good photograph.</td>', 'Very well lit, great definition and composition. A good photograph.', '2009-03-09 18:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298114, 769371, 104612, '<td valign="top">Very confusing. The subject, "skin" it is not.</td>', 'Very confusing. The subject, "skin" it is not.', '2009-03-09 18:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298116, 770057, 104612, '<td valign="top">No comment</td>', 'No comment', '2009-03-09 18:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298118, 769407, 104612, '<td valign="top">I would give this high marks except for the title. A good photograph needs no words!</td>', 'I would give this high marks except for the title. A good photograph needs no words!', '2009-03-09 18:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298124, 770016, 104612, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and fair lighting. A third light should have been used off left.</td>', 'Nice framing and fair lighting. A third light should have been used off left.', '2009-03-09 18:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298125, 769645, 104612, '<td valign="top">Backgrund not diffused enough, poles are distracting. No catch light in the eyes and sensor dust is seen. Good effort.</td>', 'Backgrund not diffused enough, poles are distracting. No catch light in the eyes and sensor dust is seen. Good effort.', '2009-03-09 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298127, 769797, 104612, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop and smaller aperture.</td>', 'Tighter crop and smaller aperture.', '2009-03-09 18:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298131, 770087, 104612, '<td valign="top">Background paper crinkled, the lighting scheme accents the model''s nose. Shadow under eyes not pleasant.</td>', 'Background paper crinkled, the lighting scheme accents the model''s nose. Shadow under eyes not pleasant.', '2009-03-09 18:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298132, 770079, 50357, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  One of my favorites and I can appreciate how difficult it must have been to take.</td>', 'This is beautiful!  One of my favorites and I can appreciate how difficult it must have been to take.', '2009-03-09 19:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298133, 769972, 104612, '<td valign="top">Wrists are never attractive nor are the backs of a person''s hands. The arms are placed as if there is something to hide, but this is a nude in recline.</td>', 'Wrists are never attractive nor are the backs of a person''s hands. The arms are placed as if there is something to hide, but this is a nude in recline.', '2009-03-09 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
