(5321095, 770088, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a quality shot. The composition is good, but there are a couple of issues I see. The skin shown is a small element of the photo. My attention is drawn to the face of the phone, which is well-lit, yet there is nothing noteworthy about it. The buttons look a bit muddy, that the may just be due to the 640 restrictions. There are pink and blue hues to the shadow and a hard line that seems out of place. Something that might have helped is a reflective surface to give the shot more depth. Of course, these are only my opinions. Take them with a grain of salt.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.</td>', 'This is a quality shot. The composition is good, but there are a couple of issues I see. The skin shown is a small element of the photo. My attention is drawn to the face of the phone, which is well-lit, yet there is nothing noteworthy about it. The buttons look a bit muddy, that the may just be due to the 640 restrictions. There are pink and blue hues to the shadow and a hard line that seems out of place. Something that might have helped is a reflective surface to give the shot more depth. Of course, these are only my opinions. Take them with a grain of salt. Keep shooting.', '2009-03-12 11:02:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5321351, 769700, 20748, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by artvet:</b></div><hr/><i> To all these people who gave this picture 4 and below: please explain your score because I don''t understand it at all. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Because I felt like it at the moment of voting.<br/>It''s been done before and I didn''t care for the original either.</td>', 'Originally posted by artvet: To all these people who gave this picture 4 and below: please explain your score because I don''t understand it at all.   Because I felt like it at the moment of voting.It''s been done before and I didn''t care for the original either.', '2009-03-12 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
