(5469310, 769781, 54645, '<td valign="top">You mentioned in the AB thread that this is one strobe. Clearly camera left, but was it perpendicular to her? What is lighting the background? Reflector? Fantastic portrait BTW!</td>', 'You mentioned in the AB thread that this is one strobe. Clearly camera left, but was it perpendicular to her? What is lighting the background? Reflector? Fantastic portrait BTW!', '2009-05-05 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5469357, 769781, 82985, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bspurgeon:</b></div><hr/><i> You mentioned in the AB thread that this is one strobe. Clearly camera left, but was it perpendicular to her? What is lighting the background? Reflector? Fantastic portrait BTW! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, a single AB800 in a rectangular softbox directly to the left, and the black side of a reflector to the right.  The background is blue seamless paper (same lighting setup as in the color outtake above, except a bit of white reflector to the right in that one).  And thanks for the compliment! :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-04 23:58:45.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by bspurgeon: You mentioned in the AB thread that this is one strobe. Clearly camera left, but was it perpendicular to her? What is lighting the background? Reflector? Fantastic portrait BTW!   Yes, a single AB800 in a rectangular softbox directly to the left, and the black side of a reflector to the right.  The background is blue seamless paper (same lighting setup as in the color outtake above, except a bit of white reflector to the right in that one).  And thanks for the compliment! :-)', '2009-05-05 00:57:57.000000', '2009-05-05 00:58:45.000000', 0),
